{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此經多不讀摩訶，據文中云深般若，題中亦應云大般若"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "轉凡成聖神妙難測"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧日當空破無明暗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無過之前無加之上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不唯無上亦無齊等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
